frogger2-rs (working title) - a Rust port of Frogger 2: Swampy's Revenge

NO GAME DATA IS INCLUDED
------------------------
This package contains only the engine/port code. It does not contain any
assets (models, textures, levels, audio, music, videos) from Frogger 2:
Swampy's Revenge. You must supply your own legitimately obtained copy
(disc image, disc folder or install folder) and import it once:

    f2-import "/path/to/your/Frogger 2 disc image, disc folder or install folder"
    f2-import --list            # show detected/imported renditions

Imported data is written to $F2_DATA_ROOT, or the platform data directory
(Linux ~/.local/share/frogger2-rs/data, Windows %APPDATA%\frogger2-rs\data,
macOS ~/Library/Application Support/frogger2-rs/data). Then run `frogger`.

